    "format": "<div class=\"cf-devflow-root\"><style>.cf-devflow-root{font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif;color:#e8e8e8;line-height:1.45;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}.cf-devflow-root .cf-h{margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:1.05rem;color:#81c784}.cf-devflow-root .cf-sub{margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:0.85rem;opacity:0.85}.cf-devflow-root .cf-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:stretch;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}.cf-devflow-root .cf-box{border:1px solid #444;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;background:#2b2b2b;flex:1 1 160px;min-width:140px}.cf-devflow-root .cf-box h4{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:0.8rem;color:#ffb74d;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em}.cf-devflow-root .cf-box ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.1em;font-size:0.82rem}.cf-devflow-root .cf-arrow{align-self:center;font-size:1.4rem;color:#888;padding:0 4px}.cf-devflow-root .cf-note{border-left:3px solid #5c6bc0;padding:8px 12px;margin-top:14px;background:#333;font-size:0.8rem}</style><p class=\"cf-h\">CronusFarm 개발 → 배포 → 서비스</p><p class=\"cf-sub\">Thalia <code>thalia.mango-larch.ts.net</code> · Pi <code>ida</code> <code>ida.mango-larch.ts.net</code> · 접속 고정은 Tailscale(내부/WiFi IP는 AP에 따라 변동)</p><div class=\"cf-row\"><div class=\"cf-box\"><h4>1 Thalia (개발)</h4><ul><li>Workspace: CronusFarm</li><li>편집: .ino, secrets, nodered JSON</li><li>SMB: <code>\\\\ida...\\MyCode</code> → <code>/home/dooly/CronusFarm</code></li><li>또는 <code>upcode.ps1</code> / deploy 스크립트 (SSH·SCP)</li></ul></div><span class=\"cf-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"cf-box\"><h4>2 ida (라즈베리 파이)</h4><ul><li>소스: <code>~/CronusFarm</code></li><li><code>arduino-cli</code> compile/upload (USB)</li><li>Mosquitto + Node-RED</li></ul></div><span class=\"cf-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"cf-box\"><h4>3 Arduino</h4><ul><li>USB로 펌웨어 수신</li><li>Pi와 동일 WiFi SSID</li><li>인터넷 시 MQTT → Pi</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"cf-row\"><div class=\"cf-box\" style=\"flex:2 1 280px\"><h4>런타임 데이터 경로</h4><ul><li>Arduino ↔ Mosquitto (MQTT)</li><li>Node-RED ↔ Mosquitto (동일 브로커)</li><li>시리얼 점유 시 업로드 충돌 → MQTT 권장 / 필요 시 NR 중지</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"cf-note\">수동 업로드(Thalia): PowerShell에서 <code>.\\\\scripts\\\\upcode.ps1</code> 또는 VS Code Task <code>upcode (copy → compile → upload Pi)</code> · Pi 단독: <code>pi-arduino-build.sh</code> (<code>docs/raspi_setup.md</code>)</div></div>",
